          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">• If this unit has the **^^Blades of Khorne^^** keyword, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of its **Hellforged Weapons** and its **Hellforged Weapons** have the **Blood-hungry** weapon ability.
• If this unit has the **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** keyword, it has **^^Wizard (1)^^**.
• If this unit has the **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** keyword, it has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.
• If this unit has the **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** keyword, add 1 run rolls and charge rolls for it.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </entryLink>
