            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Subtract 1 from ward rolls for enemy units while they are within 12&quot; of the **Corpse Cart** in this Regiment of Renown.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Legend among Graverobbers" id="e0e6-a80a-b028-1961" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Rallying</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick the **Corpse Cart** in this Regiment of Renown to use this ability if it is within 3&quot; of the **Deadwalker Zombies** unit in this Regiment of Renown. Then, pick each enemy **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^** and **^^Beast^^** unit within 12&quot; of the **Corpse Cart** to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For each target that had any models slain this turn, you can return D3 slain models to the **Deadwalker Zombies** unit in this Regiment of Renown.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
