            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick the **Gobbapalooza** in this Regiment of Renown to cast this spell, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks made by enemy units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of the caster.</characteristic>
