            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the enemy **^^Enemy of the Everchosen^^** unit is destroyed by a unit in this Regiment of Renown, add 10 to the control score of each unit in this Regiment of Renown for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
