            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a unit in this Regiment of Renown that is not in combat to use this ability.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">That unit can use the &apos;Normal Move&apos; ability as if it were your movement phase.</characteristic>
