            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick the **Ogroid Thaumaturge** in this Regiment of Renown to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target has **^^Strike-last^^** until the start of your next turn. In addition, while the target has the **^^Burning^^** keyword, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic>
