                    <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
                  </attributes>
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle Round (Army), Start of Battle Round</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">You gain 1 **swift point** for each unit in this Regiment of Ghyran that is on the battlefield. Divide those **swift points** among those units in any combination. Then, pick each friendly unit that has any **swift points** to be the targets.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Make a **swift move** for each target by rolling a number of D3 equal to the number of **swift points** it has. The target can move a number of inches equal to the swift move roll. It cannot move through or end that move within the combat ranges of enemy units.
After this ability has been resolved, your **swift points** are reset to 0 (any that have not been used are lost).</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                    <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
