                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a terrain feature within 6&quot; of a unit in this Regiment of Ghyran, then pick each enemy unit within 6&quot; of that terrain feature to be the targets.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each target and apply the corresponding effect below until the start of your next turn.
**1-2** The target cannot use commands.
**3-4** Halve the target&apos;s Move characteristic.
**5-6** Subtract 1 from the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a minimum of 1.</characteristic>
