                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a unit in this Regiment of Renown that is not in combat to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll **X**D3, where **X** is the number of enemy units within 12&quot; of the target that used a **^^Move^^** ability this phase. The target can move a number of inches equal to the roll.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
