            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick the friendly **Vokmortian** in this Regiment of Renown to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">For the rest of the turn, each time your opponent declares a **^^Fight^^** ability for the target, unless they spend 1 command point as a reaction, that **^^Fight^^** ability has no effect.
**Designer&apos;s Note:** *That* **^^Fight^^** *ability does not count as a command.*</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Masters of All Terrain" id="c8fb-5f31-0ea8-cc6c" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Ignore negative modifiers to run rolls and charge rolls for units in this Regiment of Renown and to their Move characteristic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Regiment of Renown: Dawnrider Lance" id="04f4-13f9-4974-4692" defaultAmount="0" hidden="true" import="true" publicationId="9ed1-cf74-eb97-dee2" type="upgrade">
