            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">If the **Mortek Crawler** in this Regiment of Renown is wholly within 12&quot; of and visible to the friendly **Mortisan Ossifector** in this Regiment of Renown, pick that **Mortisan Ossifector** to cast this spell, pick that **Mortek Crawler** to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, the target has ^^**Ward (5+)^^**.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic>
