            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While each model in a unit in this Regiment of Renown is contesting the amphitheatre:
• That unit&apos;s melee weapons have **Crit (Mortal)**.
• If you control the amphitheatre, if the unmodified hit roll or wound roll for an attack that targets that unit is a 1-4, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
