            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick another friendly non-**^^Unique^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn and while the target is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit:
• You can re-roll run rolls for the target.
• Add 1 to charge rolls for the target.
• The target cannot be targeted by shooting attacks.
• Add 1 to wound rolls for the target&apos;s combat attacks.
• Add 10 to the target&apos;s control score.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
